# banana — Nano Banana 图像生成

## 基本信息

- **类型**：image
- **模式**：text_to_image
- **状态**：enabled

## API 配置

- **提交接口**：POST https://grsai.dakka.com.cn/v1/draw/nano-banana
- **轮询接口**：POST https://grsai.dakka.com.cn/v1/draw/result
- **API Key**：<your_api_key_here>

## 提交接口

**请求体**：

```json
{
  "model": "nano-banana-2",
  "prompt": "{prompt}",
  "aspectRatio": "16:9",
  "imageSize": "2K",
  "urls": [],
  "webHook": "-1",
  "shutProgress": false
}
```

**响应体**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "msg": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": "id"
  }
}
```

取 `data.id` 作为任务 ID，用于轮询。

## 轮询接口

**请求方式**：POST

**请求体**：

```json
{
  "id": "{taskId}"
}
```

**响应体**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "msg": "success",
  "data": {
    "id": "xxxxx",
    "results": [
      {
        "url": "https://example.com/example.png",
        "content": "这是一只可爱的猫咪在草地上玩耍"
      }
    ],
    "progress": 100,
    "status": "succeeded",
    "failure_reason": "",
    "error": ""
  }
}
```

## 轮询说明

- 每隔 5 秒请求一次，最多轮询 20 次
- 请求体：`{"id": "{taskId}"}`
- 成功标志：`status == "succeeded"`，取 `results[0].url`
- 失败标志：`status == "failed"`，取 `failure_reason`
